# FFmpeg runtime dependencies from ALT Sisyphus
libavcodec63|
libavformat63|
libavutil61|

# Wine is configured --without-ffmpeg on RedOS 7.3 and 8.0.
# Drop inherited ALT runtime names, matching the existing disabled FFmpeg build deps.
